 The lining of the cavity is tan red and finely granular  Tan white firm indurations are within the anterior inferior aspect of the parenchyma adjacent to the cavity wall and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm tan gray cystic area is in the inferior posterior aspect  A REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm portion of attached skin is at the superior mid aspect of the specimen  The cavity comes closest to the lateral margin and measures 0 5cm  A shave of the superior margin is frozen as FX  1  Representative sections are submitted  SECTION CODE  A  FX  1  shaved superior margin  B E  Cavity to margin with focal tan white yellow circumscribed lesions under the cavity wall  F G  Breast parenchyma away from the cavity  representative sections  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  additional superior shaved margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm unoriented tan yellow soft tissue  The specimen is inked black and serially sectioned to reveal a tan to focally tan white to tan yellow indurated and focally hemorrhagic cut surface  Areas suggestive of necrosis are present  A representative section is frozen as FX  2  and submitted as H  The remainder of the specimen is entirely submitted as I M  Resident  ANDRAS SCHAFFER  MD PhD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   SUPERIOR MARGIN  FOCAL ATYPIA  CONSISTENT WITH DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  AND CANCERIZATION OF LOBULES  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL SUPERIOR MARGIN   FOCAL ATYPICAL CELLS  NOT ON DEEPERS  WITH PERILOBULAR CHRONIC INFLAMMATION  QUERY FOCAL DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  QUERY OLD MARGIN  O R  Resident  CHRISTOPHER M  WILLIAM  MD   Ph D  O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Carrie Adelia Sims  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  S