ue is yellow white  fibrofatty  with focal nodular and cystic areas  Lymph nodes are not detected in the  lateral tissue     Also received within the container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm aggregate of  unremarkable pieces of fibroadipose tissue  The following representative  sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the mass    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous tissue from the central aspect of the  specimen    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous tissue from the central inner aspect of  the specimen    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of additional pieces of fibroadipose tissue     D  Received fixed  labeled  right mastectomy flap   is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm piece  of wrinkled white skin excised to a depth of 1 2cm  The specimen is inked  black and representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      E  Received fixed  labeled  left mastectomy flap   is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm piece of  wrinkled white skin excised to a depth of 0 6cm  The specimen is inked black  and representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS   FROZEN SECTION  1   LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE    THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY     Final Diagnosis by Thomas Gudewicz M D   Electronically signed on Wednesday  REMOVED_MONTH 22   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 10 38 34AM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses               ADDENDUM NOTE   REASON   1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR  RECEPTOR PROTEINS    Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     The tumor cells do not stain for estrogen receptor protein   Some tumor cells stain faintly for progesterone receptor protein   Focally  the tumor cells show moderate  2   overexpression of  HER 2 c erbB 2   See note     Note  The tumor 